    "detailed_description": "Stuck on a mining planet, your only hope for escaping are the shimmering veins of gold beneath the surface. <br>In <i>You struck gold</i>, you embark on a strategic puzzle-solving journey. Your deck of cards is both your tool to mine precious gold and secure your ticket home!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.poster.avif?t=1754904916\" width=476 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.webm?t=1754904916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.mp4?t=1754904916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Card-Based Gameplay:</strong> Utilize a unique deck of cards, each with special abilities and tools to aid your mining efforts<br></li><li> <strong>Quick Puzzles:</strong> Enjoy fast-paced challenging puzzles that keep you engaged and on your toes<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> Choose and place your cards carefully on the board, balancing mining the gold with the more special tools at your disposal<br></li><li> <strong>A Distinctive Look:</strong> A cozy pixel-art game that uses charming 2.5D models for the cards</li></ul><br>Will you earn your fare back home, or will the planet's mining company keep you trapped forever? Test your skills in <i>You struck gold</i> and discover if you have what it takes to escape!",
    "about_the_game": "Stuck on a mining planet, your only hope for escaping are the shimmering veins of gold beneath the surface. <br>In <i>You struck gold</i>, you embark on a strategic puzzle-solving journey. Your deck of cards is both your tool to mine precious gold and secure your ticket home!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.poster.avif?t=1754904916\" width=476 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.webm?t=1754904916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3117710/extras/1195526096835209afb7c10c00975e9a.mp4?t=1754904916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Card-Based Gameplay:</strong> Utilize a unique deck of cards, each with special abilities and tools to aid your mining efforts<br></li><li> <strong>Quick Puzzles:</strong> Enjoy fast-paced challenging puzzles that keep you engaged and on your toes<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> Choose and place your cards carefully on the board, balancing mining the gold with the more special tools at your disposal<br></li><li> <strong>A Distinctive Look:</strong> A cozy pixel-art game that uses charming 2.5D models for the cards</li></ul><br>Will you earn your fare back home, or will the planet's mining company keep you trapped forever? Test your skills in <i>You struck gold</i> and discover if you have what it takes to escape!",
